  "Red Cloud Rising": {
   "rule": "Red Cloud Banner (pvd-xich-ha-ky): in a duel (rewritten from 'allies within its cloud' per the one-side-against-one-side ruling, 2026-11-26), every 3 s you gain 1 Fire buff stack of fury (15 s, raising attack) and 1 self-Burn stack (6 s, burning you for a little health each second and feeding Burning Feather heat). Once a fight, if you would go Down and are not already wearing the full Standing in the Fire set (which overrides with a 33 % rise), you rise at 20 % of your maximum health.",
