  "Burn and Get Back Up": {
   "rule": "Standing in the Fire, full set (3 pieces: pvd-xich-ha-ky, pvd-moving-fire-hide, pvd-cradle-feather): each time your body shield breaks (drops from positive to 0 on a hit taken), you regain 15 % of your maximum health and arm your next fist strike (fist art or basic blow) to deal an extra Fire free hit of 2.0. Once a fight (wearing the Xích Hà Kỳ as part of the set, superseding its 20 % rise), a blow that would put you Down leaves you standing at 33 % of your maximum health.",
   "approx": "body shield break is tracked via body_shield_up transitioning from positive to 0 on was_hit (neither engine fires shield_broken on body_bar); 'equal to the shield's value' is a fixed Fire free hit of c 2.0 because no readable returns pre-break body shield HP",
